      "comment": "HEATLEY HAYZE (1) hit the ground running and was prominent to the turn but faded out of it when 7th at this track in Grade 5 company. Should be very hard to beat this time. TRUSTFUL (2) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from five tries. Comes off a (16.76) win last time, scoring by 4 lengths in a Grade 6 over 300m at this track. Looks a key chance on best figures. UNDENIABLE GRIT (6) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (28.27) at Casino in a Grade 5 over 484m. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Bold showing expected again. LITTLE ROWDY (7) is worth consideration.",
